  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Siege Regiment",
    "summary": "Pick one support option as the round opens. All three have the same target quota: 2 for Incursion, 3 for Strike Force and 4 for Onslaught. The effects expire with the round.\n**Creeping Barrage** — Test enemy units one by one with a D6, stopping at the quota. Eligible enemies are over 12 inches from every friendly model on the board. A 5+ cuts that unit’s Move by 2 inches and its charge rolls by 2.\n**Incendiary Bombardment** — Use the same enemy range restriction. Select units directly to strip their **[Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)**.\n**Smoke Shells** — Give **[Stealth](vsdata:core-ability/stealth)** to the friendly units you pick.",
